### Ручные запросы к MCP-транспорту сервера (JetBrains HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client).
### Адрес и токен — из http-client.env.json (окружения) и http-client.private.env.json (токены, не в git).
### Сервер без сессий: каждый запрос независим, initialize перед вызовами не обязателен.

### Рукопожатие: имя сервера, версия, instructions
POST {{mcpHost}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"initialize","params":{"protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","capabilities":{},"clientInfo":{"name":"http-client","version":"0"}}}

### Список инструментов со схемами аргументов и ответов
POST {{mcpHost}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tools/list","params":{}}

### Списки задач
POST {{mcpHost}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"get_task_lists","arguments":{}}}

### Невыполненные задачи
POST {{mcpHost}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":4,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"get_tasks","arguments":{"completed":false}}}

### Создать задачу в Inbox
POST {{mcpHost}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":5,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"create_task","arguments":{"title":"Проверка MCP","plannedDay":"2026-11-01"}}}

### Изменить задачу: сброс срока пустой строкой
POST {{mcpHost}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":6,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"update_task","arguments":{"id":"{{taskId}}","plannedDay":""}}}

### Выполнить задачу
POST {{mcpHost}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":7,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"set_task_completed","arguments":{"id":"{{taskId}}","completed":true}}}

### Удалить задачу (отклоняется, пока есть живые теги или блокеры)
POST {{mcpHost}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":8,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"delete_task","arguments":{"id":"{{taskId}}"}}}

### Без токена — 401
POST {{mcpHost}}/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":9,"method":"initialize","params":{}}
